          {
            "Text": "Whether or not this answer is desired from the perspective of the survey creator. A desired answer indicates that based on the intent of the survey, the survey creator would prefer the survey taker to pick this answer over other answers where desired is false. For example Somewhat Familiar would be desirable, but Not Familiar wouldn\u0027t.",
